STEP 9 GOAL p ∣ n ^ 2 - n + 1 → p ∣ (n + 2) ^ 6 - 1
STEP 10 GOAL p ∣ (n + 1) ^ 6 - 1 ∨ p ∣ (n + 2) ^ 6 - 1
